      "updated": 1717459200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LFUEvictionPolicy<K>   implements EvictionPolicy<K>\n──────────────\n- keyFreq: HashMap<K, Integer>\n- freqBuckets:\n     HashMap<Integer, LinkedHashSet<K>>\n- minFreq: int\n──────────────\n+ keyAdded(K)               O(1)\n+ keyAccessed(K)            O(1)\n+ keyRemoved(K)             O(1)\n+ selectEvictionCandidate() O(1)\n\nLRU tiebreak comes free from LinkedHashSet",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LFUEvictionPolicy<K>   implements EvictionPolicy<K>\n──────────────\n- keyFreq: HashMap<K, Integer>\n- freqBuckets:\n     HashMap<Integer, LinkedHashSet<K>>\n- minFreq: int\n──────────────\n+ keyAdded(K)               O(1)\n+ keyAccessed(K)            O(1)\n+ keyRemoved(K)             O(1)\n+ selectEvictionCandidate() O(1)\n\nLRU tiebreak comes free from LinkedHashSet",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
